# Placing and using shapes, on Inbox/Gestures.canvas, which tests/drive.rs writes first: a Venn
# bound to two volcano queries and a sticky. `s` places the workspace's checklist bound to the
# tasks of Inbox/Field Season; a click on a task ticks it through the gateway and it leaves the
# box. The sticky's text is edited in place while another program moves the Venn: both are
# kept. "Make it a note" turns the sticky into a note and a card on it; Enter on the card opens
# the note, and Back returns. Dropping a volcano into the Venn's lens is refused (its tags are
# read from the text, which a field edit can't write). tests/drive.rs reads the files after.
size 140x44
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace
keys w
wait-for whiteboards · type to filter · ⏎ open · Esc back
type gestures
keys enter
wait-for whiteboard Gestures · 2 cards · 0 arrows
wait-for Stratovolcanoes
# The sticky, edited in place while the Venn is moved outside.
click 9 100
wait-for shape sticky · Sticky note
keys enter
wait-for editing · type text
type , for the trip
write Inbox/Gestures.canvas {"nodes":[\n{"id":"venn","type":"text","text":"Simple Venn diagram","x":-100,"y":0,"width":600,"height":600,"cold-lava":{"shape":"venn2","inputs":{"a":{"query":{"kind":"volcano","filter":{"tag":"eruption"},"title":"Erupted"}},"b":{"query":{"kind":"volcano","filter":{"tag":"volcano/strato"},"title":"Stratovolcanoes"}}}}},\n{"id":"sticky","type":"text","text":"Ash masks\u000aTwo per person","x":700,"y":0,"width":300,"height":140,"cold-lava":{"shape":"sticky","node":"text"}}\n],"edges":[],"cold-lava-version":1}\n
wait 500ms
keys esc
wait-for merged changes made outside cold-lava
wait-for the trip
keys esc
wait-for  Inbox/Gestures.canvas
keys s
wait-for place a shape · type to filter
type check
wait-for checklist  Checklist  · workspace
keys enter
wait-for bind checklist
type type=task note="Inbox/Field Season.md" title="Field season"
keys enter
wait-for shape checklist · Checklist  550×220  0 arrows
expect-in 14 50 14 90 Field season
expect-in 22 40 22 100 Pack the gas masks
click 22 68
wait-for canvas: ticked on Field Season
wait-gone Pack the gas masks
expect Book the flight to Kīlauea
# Make it a note: the sticky becomes a note, and a card on it in the same place.
click 20 5
wait-for shape sticky · Sticky note
keys x
wait-for what the shape does
expect Make it a note
keys enter
wait-for created Ash masks.md · now a card
wait-for shape card · Card (a note)  300×140
keys z
wait-for 75%
# A volcano dropped from only "Erupted" into the lens: refused, nothing written.
drag 22 10 22 25
wait-for can't be written
# Enter on the card opens its note in the menu; Back comes back.
click 11 70
wait-for shape card
keys enter
wait-for Two per person, for the trip
wait-gone whiteboard Gestures
keys ctrl+o
wait-for whiteboard Gestures · 3 cards
keys q
wait-for reading · j
keys q
wait-for ? help  q quit
keys q
exits 0
